Servo motor controller. Consisting of two boards, one power and one
control board. The design is made in kicad.

Working supply voltage from 50V to 650V, output current depends on used
MOSFETs but using the Rohm SCT4018 (and sufficient cooling) 20A should
not be a problem.

Currently supported encoders:

Hiperface (make sure to set the powersupply voltage to 8V instead of 12V)
Mitubishi HC-MFS and HC-PQ
CUI AMT213A-V

Additionally linear scales using incremental encoders and index pulses
can be used.
